Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.32,1:12:51.30,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(112,112)}{\pos(792,526)}D{\fs55}y{\fs}w
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:43.02,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0030, 0035)}{\pos(792,526)}D{\fs55}y{\fs}w
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:49.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator and editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.14,0:02:51.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistants:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Sana, Martini
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.14,0:02:53.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Typesetter translators: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee, tommo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.70,0:00:50.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Hold on, madam
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.79,0:00:52.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t close your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.62,0:00:53.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t fall asleep
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.30,0:01:06.26,captions,,0,0,0,,I must make Do Hwa mine. If she gets pregnant, then the child is mine
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.35,0:01:08.35,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.10,0:01:12.27,memories,,0,0,0,,last week was incredible
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.23,0:01:18.69,memories,,0,0,0,,Do Hwa soon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.03,0:01:21.99,memories,,0,0,0,,will give birth to my son
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.41,0:01:25.53,memories,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:30.04,memories,,0,0,0,,Remember the prediction I received on the day of my coronation?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.62,0:01:34.12,memories,,0,0,0,,You said I would have a son
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.92,0:01:37.96,memories,,0,0,0,,who will have the energy of the royal star
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.54,0:01:42.21,memories,,0,0,0,,The prediction was wrong. It's impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.68,0:01:45.88,memories,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.43,0:01:50.06,memories,,0,0,0,,This must become true
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:54.18,memories,,0,0,0,,I will have a son thanks to your alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.98,0:01:57.69,memories,,0,0,0,,Remember this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.90,0:02:00.77,memories,,0,0,0,,Do Hwa carries and gives birth
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.69,0:02:04.15,memories,,0,0,0,,my son
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:08.53,memories,,0,0,0,,He will be mine
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.01,0:03:10.64,memories italics,,0,0,0,,The star in the center of the Big Dipper, which means the secrets of nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.72,0:03:15.35,memories italics,,0,0,0,,appears only when the sky is filled with the energy of Deho waters
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.36,0:03:26.19,memories italics,,0,0,0,,My son will be born when this star shines
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.58,0:03:39.96,memories,,0,0,0,,From now on, I forbid Chan Wook from entering Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.29,0:03:42.63,memories,,0,0,0,,One hit left
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.71,0:03:44.09,memories,,0,0,0,,And apply this last one yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.98,0:04:01.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.31,0:04:05.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Is the young master still silent?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:10.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. They hit me on the back, and it felt like my tongue had been hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.78,0:04:13.20,general text,,0,0,0,,He burst into tears even when he hit his finger
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.28,0:04:15.95,general text,,0,0,0,,And after a hundred blows he is silent, like a fish
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.03,0:04:17.12,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm worried
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.20,0:04:20.29,general text,,0,0,0,,He’s a crybaby, so I think he can still bear it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.71,0:04:25.75,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s not his back that hurts, but his heart
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.88,0:04:30.80,general text,,0,0,0,,He was abandoned by the man he considered his father
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:32.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Imagine what it’s like for him
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.76,0:04:35.55,general text,,0,0,0,,How abandoned he feels
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.58,0:05:01.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Be glad you got spanked
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.16,0:05:05.33,general text,,0,0,0,,They won’t be able to take the energy right now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.42,0:05:07.34,general text,,0,0,0,,You have more time to train
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.35,0:05:19.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Host
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.31,0:05:21.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.62,0:05:43.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok, look
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.83,0:05:46.12,general text,,0,0,0,,I think these circles on the water are my merit
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:52.38,general text,,0,0,0,,It's just ripples
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.09,0:05:56.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Why doesn’t it work? I trained my breathing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.97,0:05:59.30,general text,,0,0,0,,So this is what you were doing in silence
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.39,0:06:02.60,general text,,0,0,0,,And I thought you were drowning in an ocean of sadness because you kicked me out
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.68,0:06:05.27,general text,,0,0,0,,- I was wrong\N- Am I drowning in an ocean of sadness?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.35,0:06:07.35,general text,,0,0,0,,I have been abandoned since birth
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.44,0:06:09.69,general text,,0,0,0,,And it’s not the first time I’ve been chased away from somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.77,0:06:11.23,general text,,0,0,0,,It doesn’t bother me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.03,0:06:18.53,general text,,0,0,0,,You'll see
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.62,0:06:22.04,general text,,0,0,0,,I will make them beg me to return to Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.45,0:06:25.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Idiocy is sometimes useful, apparently
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.71,0:06:26.71,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a manifestation of power!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:33.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is it so hot here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.71,0:06:35.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Is it hot? I'm cold
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.34,0:06:40.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did the water get so hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.47,0:06:43.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you burning?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.93,0:06:48.69,general text,,0,0,0,,I feel strange. The temperature is rising
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.77,0:06:50.11,general text,,0,0,0,,This is energy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.23,0:06:52.44,general text,,0,0,0,,But so soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:56.90,general text,,0,0,0,,It's a matter of spanking
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.99,0:06:59.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Because of her, there was a surge of energy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.91,0:07:01.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Glad you got spanked
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.49,0:07:06.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, I’m on fire
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.33,0:07:09.67,general text,,0,0,0,,You will be hot while energy turns into heat
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.75,0:07:11.88,general text,,0,0,0,,And it will be cold when it cools down
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.96,0:07:14.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Energy will only be yours if you handle it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.76,0:07:18.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Breathe slowly
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.39,0:07:27.81,general text,,0,0,0,,This is cold water
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.49,0:07:42.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.37,0:07:45.04,general text,,0,0,0,,is the young master still bathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.12,0:07:47.08,general text,,0,0,0,,An hour has almost passed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.75,0:07:51.88,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,If she finds out, she will tell everything in Sosnovy Bor, and we will lose energy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:52.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Medicinal herbs
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.38,0:07:56.63,general text,,0,0,0,,He bathes in the herbs
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.21,0:07:58.92,general text,,0,0,0,,I have prepared the herbs,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.01,0:08:01.84,general text,,0,0,0,,and he bathes in them so that the wounds heal
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:03.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.31,0:08:06.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Good idea
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.64,0:08:10.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Stand
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.90,0:08:19.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is the water cold then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:21.03,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:24.07,general text,,0,0,0,,The water should have cooled down over the past hour
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.16,0:08:26.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Why do you still bring him cold instead of hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.79,0:08:30.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Does he have a fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.08,0:08:33.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:39.46,general text,,0,0,0,,She’s icy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.17,0:08:41.76,general text,,0,0,0,,How did you let this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:43.30,general text,,0,0,0,,What if he gets sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.14,0:08:53.06,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Boiling water suddenly turned icy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.15,0:08:54.23,italics,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.77,0:08:57.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.82,0:09:05.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.99,0:09:07.20,italics,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.28,0:09:10.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Swimming relaxed my body and I began to feel sleepy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.33,0:09:15.88,italics,,0,0,0,,What are you worth? Prepare a place to sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.17,0:09:20.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Cold. Now he's freezing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.68,0:09:29.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm cold. It's like I'm turning into ice
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:34.39,general text,,0,0,0,,The cold is spreading. Your energy is growing faster than I thought
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.65,0:09:36.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Keep breathing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.51,0:10:03.97,general text,,0,0,0,,So cold that the mind becomes cloudy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.18,0:10:08.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Hold on. You should
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.64,0:10:13.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook! Don't fall asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.27,0:10:15.06,general text,,0,0,0,,If you fall asleep, you will freeze to death
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:16.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Get up
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.81,0:10:20.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Breathe
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.03,0:10:34.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Uncle, Yul and I are Uka’s only friends
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.62,0:10:37.12,general text,,0,0,0,,And Sosnovy Bor is the only place he calls home
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.21,0:10:40.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Let him come back
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.09,0:10:41.80,general text,,0,0,0,,He still can’t train
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.30,0:10:43.96,general text,,0,0,0,,They won’t accept him anywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.05,0:10:46.34,general text,,0,0,0,,when they find out that they kicked them out of here too
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:49.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Enough talking about him
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.85,0:10:53.10,general text,,0,0,0,,From now on, focus on the nomads and soulswallows
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.94,0:11:04.23,general text,,0,0,0,,He’s like stone
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.53,0:11:06.90,general text,,0,0,0,,So he turned to stone
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.37,0:11:11.78,general text,,0,0,0,,When nomads run wild,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.87,0:11:15.00,general text,,0,0,0,,they lose energy, so they suck it out of people
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.25,0:11:19.29,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s like an evil spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.37,0:11:22.00,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s clear why you prohibit this witchcraft
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.09,0:11:24.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Alchemy of souls was not originally witchcraft
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.55,0:11:27.17,general text,,0,0,0,,It can be mastered
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.26,0:11:30.68,general text,,0,0,0,,only having mastered Chipsu, Ryusa, Chisa and finally Hwansu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.76,0:11:32.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Hwangsu... This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.35,0:11:35.77,general text,,0,0,0,,when can you exchange fire for water and vice versa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.85,0:11:38.06,general text,,0,0,0,,- People can’t do this\N- Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.14,0:11:40.73,general text,,0,0,0,,But Master So Kyung, the founder of Pine Forest, was able
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.81,0:11:42.56,general text,,0,0,0,,There was another one
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.65,0:11:43.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.77,0:11:45.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Otherwise I’ll tell you the name and you’ll understand
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.15,0:11:49.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Who dared to try this alchemy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.91,0:11:52.57,general text,,0,0,0,,on our poor student?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.66,0:11:56.37,general text,,0,0,0,,He was supposed to work in Jeonbugwan, read the stars
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.45,0:11:58.71,general text,,0,0,0,,He has been there often for the last few months
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.62,0:12:02.21,italics,,0,0,0,,Exactly. There are also those who caught Nak Su's people
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.29,0:12:04.71,general text,,0,0,0,,We couldn’t, but these seemed to be waiting for them
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.79,0:12:07.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they have something to do with
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.30,0:12:09.42,general text,,0,0,0,,to this soul swallower
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.38,0:12:14.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul, Dan Gu, watch Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.26,0:12:16.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Suddenly you notice something strange
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.68,0:12:17.56,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.06,0:12:21.65,general text,,0,0,0,,What about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.73,0:12:24.02,general text,,0,0,0,,The door has been working intermittently since Uk broke it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.07,0:12:27.15,general text,,0,0,0,,- Chan Wook...\N- Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.86,0:12:29.07,general text,,0,0,0,,The floor will fall through
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.49,0:12:33.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t move
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.41,0:12:36.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait until the door is completely closed
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.20,0:12:38.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.62,0:12:41.50,general text,,0,0,0,,I told you not to move!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.58,0:12:43.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.46,0:12:46.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Hold still
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.96,0:12:49.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.33,0:13:22.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Lie down for now
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.85,0:13:42.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Sapsari
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.06,0:13:44.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Come out
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.94,0:13:46.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.15,0:14:32.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Glad you're back
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.61,0:14:40.87,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a treat if you find a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.95,0:14:42.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope we work together
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.65,0:15:13.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.65,0:15:17.36,general text,,0,0,0,,If I freeze to death,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.95,0:15:20.62,general text,,0,0,0,,take my energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:24.91,general text,,0,0,0,,if you can
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.20,0:15:29.08,general text,,0,0,0,,If I could, I would have killed you long ago and taken you away
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:33.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm freezing here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.26,0:15:37.26,general text,,0,0,0,,and you throw cold phrases
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.26,0:15:40.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Say something warm
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.34,0:15:43.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.51,0:15:44.81,general text,,0,0,0,,You’ll say the same
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.64,0:15:51.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook, open your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.52,0:15:55.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, I’ll say something warm
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.36,0:16:01.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Where I lived, a huge tree grew
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.74,0:16:06.62,general text,,0,0,0,,At the very top there was a nest
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.29,0:16:09.04,general text,,0,0,0,,There was one egg in it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.54,0:16:11.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.92,0:16:14.92,general text,,0,0,0,,You will feel warm from my words
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.30,0:16:22.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother bird flew in and sat on him
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.43,0:16:31.85,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm like an egg at the very top of a tree
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.27,0:16:36.86,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:40.65,general text,,0,0,0,,and I’m powerless
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.82,0:16:47.41,general text,,0,0,0,,You are the only one who can take care of me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.46,0:16:52.71,general text,,0,0,0,,My life
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.00,0:16:55.84,general text,,0,0,0,,in your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.30,0:17:04.59,general text,,0,0,0,,How warm
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.73,0:17:12.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Continue
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.44,0:17:19.48,general text,,0,0,0,,And there was also a cave
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.78,0:17:24.03,general text,,0,0,0,,A bear cub lived in it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.06,0:17:57.44,memories,,0,0,0,,You can’t even pick up your father’s sword
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.52,0:17:59.27,memories,,0,0,0,,How do you want to learn spells?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.03,0:18:03.49,memories,,0,0,0,,No one in Daeho can resist your father
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.57,0:18:05.70,memories,,0,0,0,,and open the gates of your energy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.78,0:18:08.58,memories,,0,0,0,,This is the fate that was given to you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.58,0:18:11.16,memories,,0,0,0,,your father
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.52,0:18:33.68,general text,,0,0,0,,You're not ready yet
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.98,0:18:42.44,general text,,0,0,0,,draw the magic sword
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.07,0:18:46.15,general text,,0,0,0,,You must master Ryusu and learn how to release energy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.95,0:18:50.16,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t do this yet, because you can’t control your energy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.91,0:18:53.79,general text,,0,0,0,,My father left this sword when he abandoned me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.87,0:18:56.08,general text,,0,0,0,,I will only get to Sosnovy Bor by exposing it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.83,0:19:00.92,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to do this and show them
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.13,0:19:03.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this a manifestation of stupidity?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.55,0:19:04.84,general text,,0,0,0,,No, forces
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.09,0:19:09.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Be strong, Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.03,0:19:30.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.24,0:19:32.70,general text,,0,0,0,,We arrived at Chang Gan's house, gwangju Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.04,0:19:38.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Young Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.29,0:19:42.67,general text,,0,0,0,,You have a guest
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.38,0:19:44.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.38,0:19:47.63,general text,,0,0,0,,The Crown Prince has arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.99,0:20:12.82,italics,,0,0,0,,The weather is absolutely perfect
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.91,0:20:16.08,italics,,0,0,0,,for fishing with Wook near Gyeongcheongdaeho
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.16,0:20:20.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he came to his senses
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.54,0:20:24.63,general text,,0,0,0,,I decided to visit him since I’m worried
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.71,0:20:26.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you getting involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.80,0:20:29.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to check something
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.26,0:20:31.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I said something to his maid
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.39,0:20:35.01,general text,,0,0,0,,We visit him as friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.10,0:20:36.68,general text,,0,0,0,,why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.81,0:20:39.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I stumbled upon you by accident
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.02,0:20:43.69,general text,,0,0,0,,And I also have something to find fault with him for
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.77,0:20:46.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I see, I was going to get him
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.90,0:20:48.44,general text,,0,0,0,,What's in the package?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.32,0:20:53.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Medicine for his wounds
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.03,0:20:57.83,general text,,0,0,0,,First you give him medicine, and then you sit on his ears
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.04,0:21:01.33,italics,,0,0,0,,Incredible
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.37,0:21:05.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you come for the sword of Nak Su?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.63,0:21:07.55,general text,,0,0,0,,The king entrusted it to Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.05,0:21:11.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu, the deputy of Gwangju must keep it, since there is no Gwangju himself
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.51,0:21:18.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Since you came here in person, I will pass it on to you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.39,0:21:19.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Take it
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.10,0:21:20.93,italics,,0,0,0,,Bring the sword
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.73,0:21:23.85,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s not all
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:26.98,general text,,0,0,0,,There is another sword here that you cannot draw
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.65,0:21:32.15,general text,,0,0,0,,The late king granted it to Gwangju Chang Gang
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.78,0:21:34.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to take him too
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.45,0:21:37.24,general text,,0,0,0,,But it belongs to his father
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.95,0:21:39.66,general text,,0,0,0,,The sword by right of the young master
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.74,0:21:41.29,general text,,0,0,0,,But he was never trusted with this sword
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.66,0:21:44.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Previously it was stored in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.96,0:21:47.88,general text,,0,0,0,,You took it when you were thrown out of there, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.59,0:21:53.09,general text,,0,0,0,,The Royal Palace will keep it until the election of a new Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.93,0:21:56.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Bring me a sword
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.39,0:22:04.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t give it away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.52,0:22:10.32,general text,,0,0,0,,As you know, they don’t recognize me as their father’s son
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.86,0:22:14.61,general text,,0,0,0,,If I also lose my sword, it won’t end well for me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.74,0:22:18.24,general text,,0,0,0,,It will be kept by me, albeit only as decoration
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.87,0:22:23.91,general text,,0,0,0,,I have to pick him up,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.66,0:22:26.96,general text,,0,0,0,,and you refuse. Nothing to do
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.29,0:22:30.96,general text,,0,0,0,,The winner takes the sword
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.02,0:22:51.65,general text,,0,0,0,,You are not particularly trained to fight for a real battle
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.53,0:23:00.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you push beyond this line,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.28,0:23:02.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll leave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.30,0:23:21.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you expected me to grovel before you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.26,0:23:26.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Going against you is a manifestation of stupidity
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:29.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Still, some consider this a manifestation of strength
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.40,0:23:30.44,general text,,0,0,0,,So I'll try
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.82,0:24:25.16,memories,,0,0,0,,This is energy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.24,0:24:26.54,memories,,0,0,0,,It's about the spanking
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.62,0:24:28.66,memories,,0,0,0,,There was a surge of energy because of her
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.54,0:24:30.54,memories,,0,0,0,,Glad you got spanked
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.17,0:24:34.88,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Okay, you can hit as much as you want
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.00,0:25:55.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Back!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.92,0:25:57.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Caution! It's from the chamber pot!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.06,0:26:11.60,general text,,0,0,0,,What have you done!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.02,0:26:13.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.31,0:26:18.15,general text,,0,0,0,,- I serve the master\N- How dare the maid interfere?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.86,0:26:23.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.36,0:26:25.03,general text,,0,0,0,,My maid is impudent
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.62,0:26:28.53,general text,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.33,0:26:33.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Disgusting
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.87,0:26:35.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Go home, change clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.37,0:26:38.54,general text,,0,0,0,,- What?\N - You stepped over the line
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.63,0:26:44.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course, you didn’t want to get dirty, but still,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.63,0:26:45.80,general text,,0,0,0,,this is a loss
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.88,0:26:49.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Keep your word and leave me my father's sword
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.26,0:26:51.81,italics,,0,0,0,,As you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.89,0:26:54.43,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t be able to accompany you because I’m seriously wounded
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.15,0:27:03.44,general text,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.44,0:27:05.65,italics,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.74,0:27:07.57,general text,,0,0,0,,I will keep my word and leave the sword
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.28,0:27:09.28,general text,,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.37,0:27:11.91,general text,,0,0,0,,I will punish her
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.12,0:27:19.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t forgive her for her soiled clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.60,0:28:15.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I drew my sword...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.19,0:28:30.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.99,0:28:33.57,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought you couldn't cast spells,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.66,0:28:35.41,general text,,0,0,0,,and you fooled us all
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.99,0:28:36.83,general text,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.45,0:28:39.54,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.63,0:28:48.05,general text,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.13,0:28:50.42,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare you raise a sword against the Crown Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.51,0:28:52.68,general text,,0,0,0,,- No, it’s not me\N- Uk, put down your sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.68,0:28:55.89,general text,,0,0,0,,- Lower it now\N- I'm trying
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.47,0:28:57.47,general text,,0,0,0,,But I can’t
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.87,0:29:22.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop right now, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.50,0:29:25.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t control him!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.64,0:29:38.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.64,0:29:40.89,general text,,0,0,0,,die!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.78,0:29:51.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.20,0:30:02.29,general text,,0,0,0,,- Stop\N- I don’t control my hand
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.37,0:30:03.71,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.12,0:30:07.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I... I didn’t mean to
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.63,0:30:10.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Young Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.01,0:30:18.01,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a binding bracelet
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.10,0:30:20.76,general text,,0,0,0,,His weight will keep your hand under control
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.15,0:30:30.82,offscreen,,0,0,0,,His energy poured into one hand and was uncontrollable
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.44,0:30:33.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Untie him!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.16,0:30:37.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.28,0:30:39.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Grab the sword
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.62,0:30:42.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.66,0:30:44.66,general text,,0,0,0,,He is no match for you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.75,0:30:46.33,general text,,0,0,0,,You are witnesses to this
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.42,0:30:48.96,general text,,0,0,0,,He pointed his father's sword at me
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.04,0:30:51.59,general text,,0,0,0,,He just didn’t control his energy
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.67,0:30:54.17,general text,,0,0,0,,- He even hit me, you saw\N- Be silent!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.18,0:30:58.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, you were the first to point the blade of your sword at him
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.35,0:31:01.39,general text,,0,0,0,,The sword you waved in anger is broken
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.47,0:31:03.89,general text,,0,0,0,,You must observe the customs of the magicians and return to the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.02,0:31:09.98,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare you resist my will?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.40,0:31:16.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan, Jin, Seo and Park. All four are in front of me
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.95,0:31:19.57,general text,,0,0,0,,I refuse to leave defeated
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.66,0:31:20.82,general text,,0,0,0,,What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.08,0:31:24.83,general text,,0,0,0,,All four of you attack
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.63,0:31:34.51,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s bad
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.59,0:31:37.59,general text,,0,0,0,,It looks like our families went against the royal family
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.67,0:31:39.59,italics,,0,0,0,,Everything is getting serious
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.68,0:31:41.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Young provoked him
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.35,0:31:43.01,general text,,0,0,0,,What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.56,0:31:46.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Then we’ll just give him Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.48,0:31:47.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.27,0:31:50.69,general text,,0,0,0,,These are the main families of Deho
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.31,0:31:52.73,general text,,0,0,0,,The king will be furious,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.82,0:31:54.40,general text,,0,0,0,,if he hears about this fight
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.90,0:31:58.24,general text,,0,0,0,,So what? Should I just leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.45,0:32:01.53,general text,,0,0,0,,You should have stopped me earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.67,0:32:16.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.10,0:32:26.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.14,0:32:31.15,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare I, such a rat, spill feces
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.23,0:32:32.48,general text,,0,0,0,,on your clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.65,0:32:39.95,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry. Very
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.03,0:32:41.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Go away
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.24,0:32:43.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Disappear. You stink
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.58,0:32:46.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Forgive us
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.75,0:32:55.54,general text,,0,0,0,,As a sign of sincere regret, I will finish what is left
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.46,0:32:58.71,general text,,0,0,0,,So forgive us
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.68,0:33:09.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.98,0:33:14.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.86,0:33:17.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.07,0:33:22.61,general text,,0,0,0,,I have to drink this
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.49,0:33:25.82,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.62,0:33:29.20,general text,,0,0,0,,This is not so
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.29,0:33:31.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Why you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.21,0:33:33.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I am the reason for this, so I will drink
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.79,0:33:36.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Not at all. His Highness is angry with me
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.71,0:33:38.75,general text,,0,0,0,,I must drink
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.38,0:33:44.38,general text,,0,0,0,,And there’s a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.22,0:33:47.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's come here, I'll have a drink
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.97,0:33:49.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Then shall we share?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.43,0:33:52.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Why share this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.73,0:33:54.06,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.14,0:33:55.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Take everything
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.36,0:33:59.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I’ll drink a little and give it to you
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.61,0:34:02.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Help me lift, my hand can’t move
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.32,0:34:07.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.83,0:34:13.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.50,0:34:15.46,general text,,0,0,0,,drinking
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.63,0:34:17.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Forget
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.67,0:34:19.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Why do you need it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.63,0:34:20.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Get out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.84,0:34:23.09,italics,,0,0,0,,How many are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.17,0:34:24.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.43,0:34:27.72,general text,,0,0,0,,- Seriously?\N- Come here
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.39,0:34:32.47,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the truth from the pot...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.85,0:34:37.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.15,0:34:39.15,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare we compete with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.86,0:34:41.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Do they really need to drink
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.36,0:34:43.61,general text,,0,0,0,,this crap as an apology?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.99,0:34:48.37,general text,,0,0,0,,To you
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.49,0:34:52.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop. I'm sick of you
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.16,0:34:56.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.08,0:35:01.46,general text,,0,0,0,,His Highness is leaving! Bow your heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.18,0:35:09.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did he even come?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.26,0:35:12.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Behind the sword of Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.93,0:35:14.85,general text,,0,0,0,,And then suddenly a fight started
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.52,0:35:18.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Today he left, but knowing his character,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.85,0:35:20.52,general text,,0,0,0,,he will definitely take revenge
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.03,0:35:26.36,general text,,0,0,0,,- Are you okay?\N- He hit me so many times
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.45,0:35:28.99,italics,,0,0,0,,And you hit me hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.45,0:35:33.16,italics,,0,0,0,,- Are you okay?\N- I think so
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.24,0:35:34.49,general text,,0,0,0,,- It hurts\N- Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.58,0:35:35.91,general text,,0,0,0,,- Does it hurt here?\N- It hurts
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.00,0:35:38.58,general text,,0,0,0,,- It hurts everywhere\N- Don’t touch him
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.54,0:35:44.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.34,0:35:49.64,general text,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.51,0:35:53.51,general text,,0,0,0,,You came for the Nak Su sword, here you go
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.39,0:35:56.48,general text,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.31,0:35:58.85,general text,,0,0,0,,I came to pick him up
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.94,0:36:02.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I brought it so you don't have to come back a second time
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.86,0:36:04.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Please take it
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.98,0:36:08.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to tell me to take what I came for and not come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.53,0:36:13.58,general text,,0,0,0,,You are so smart, insightful and strong
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.66,0:36:15.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you laughing at me because I lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.95,0:36:18.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Lose? You got what you wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.87,0:36:20.87,general text,,0,0,0,,And he lost it
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.96,0:36:23.96,general text,,0,0,0,,The winner here is you
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.46,0:36:30.05,general text,,0,0,0,,She's right, Your Highness. You won
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.88,0:36:33.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.18,0:36:36.47,general text,,0,0,0,,So be it
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.44,0:36:42.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Besides, you are very generous
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.69,0:36:45.65,general text,,0,0,0,,There is no such noble person in the world as you
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.20,0:36:51.36,general text,,0,0,0,,What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.49,0:36:55.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.28,0:36:57.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.79,0:36:59.62,general text,,0,0,0,,You spilled water from a pot on me
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.71,0:37:01.33,general text,,0,0,0,,From now on I will call you Won Mu Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.00,0:37:05.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Like your name, you stink of dirt
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.59,0:37:14.34,general text,,0,0,0,,You even gave me a name
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.43,0:37:17.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for your kindness
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.31,0:37:23.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.77,0:37:26.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Forward
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.82,0:37:39.33,voiceover,,0,0,0,,My student is still too weak to fight you
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.41,0:37:43.08,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Until he becomes stronger, he better not ruin his relationship with you
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.21,0:37:53.01,general text,,0,0,0,,You easily fall in love or ingratiate yourself with others
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.09,0:37:54.47,general text,,0,0,0,,for the sake of your master?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.55,0:37:57.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I couldn’t fight him, so I doused him
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.14,0:38:02.02,general text,,0,0,0,,I stink, you better not come near me
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.11,0:38:08.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Wipe yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.57,0:38:15.28,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare I stain the thing of the man I love?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.28,0:38:17.53,general text,,0,0,0,,No, thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.49,0:38:55.53,general text,,0,0,0,,I really became Stinky Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.49,0:39:04.37,general text,,0,0,0,,You wash your face too, you probably stink
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.43,0:39:24.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher, I finally did it
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.83,0:39:54.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwiga was stolen from Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.05,0:39:59.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Only members of the Jin family can open this door
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.51,0:40:03.76,general text,,0,0,0,,They must have called him from outside
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.47,0:40:06.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Theft in Jinyeowon?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.98,0:40:10.15,general text,,0,0,0,,You grieved for your dead daughter for years,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.23,0:40:13.61,general text,,0,0,0,,this must have weakened you
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.73,0:40:16.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Shameless rude
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.53,0:40:20.99,general text,,0,0,0,,You may be illegitimate, but still part of the Jin family
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.07,0:40:23.16,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare you slander your half-sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.24,0:40:24.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Scoundrel
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.45,0:40:25.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I am the deputy of Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.83,0:40:28.46,general text,,0,0,0,,I would appreciate it if you showed more respect
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.38,0:40:39.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr, please go out into the yard. Chan Wook came to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.15,0:41:03.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I forbade him to appear here
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.20,0:41:06.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you bring him with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.66,0:41:09.45,general text,,0,0,0,,You need to see something
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.67,0:41:18.55,general text,,0,0,0,,This is my father's sword
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.34,0:41:22.72,italics,,0,0,0,,When I was younger, you said you would accept me if I could bare it
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.39,0:41:24.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.30,0:42:08.01,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought he only recently opened the gates of his energy
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.72,0:42:11.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I see that he has mastered the flow of my energy
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.39,0:42:14.48,italics,,0,0,0,,As you would expect from Chang Gang's son
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.56,0:42:16.69,general text,,0,0,0,,He mastered Ryusu in the blink of an eye
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.40,0:42:20.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Please take me to your place,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.48,0:42:22.40,general text,,0,0,0,,master
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.24,0:42:28.87,general text,,0,0,0,,What's on your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.45,0:42:31.70,general text,,0,0,0,,His energy is concentrated in his right hand
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.79,0:42:33.08,italics,,0,0,0,,He doesn’t control her yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.16,0:42:35.12,general text,,0,0,0,,so we put a restraint bracelet on him
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.72,0:42:48.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Take it off
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.60,0:42:52.14,general text,,0,0,0,,If we take him off, his hand will stop obeying
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.22,0:42:55.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Let him film it later, after training
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.10,0:42:57.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Shoot
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.63,0:43:27.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to see how you hold a sword
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.54,0:44:00.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Tie his arm
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.60,0:44:15.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you... okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.93,0:44:18.85,general text,,0,0,0,,What is the point of drawing the sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.81,0:44:22.56,general text,,0,0,0,,if you can’t even hold it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.74,0:44:30.66,italics,,0,0,0,,He just can’t control her yet
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.74,0:44:32.91,italics,,0,0,0,,But he has incredible strength
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.99,0:44:34.49,general text,,0,0,0,,He even defeated the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.54,0:44:37.91,italics,,0,0,0,,He broke His Highness's sword
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.50,0:44:40.54,italics,,0,0,0,,Although he had long ago mastered Ryusu
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.62,0:44:42.17,italics,,0,0,0,,UK won
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.71,0:44:45.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Cho Young, don’t interfere
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.09,0:44:48.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, mother
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.34,0:44:54.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk, did you really point the sword against the Crown Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.68,0:44:56.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Ne Uk started a fight
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.51,0:44:58.39,general text,,0,0,0,,You pointed a sword at the Crown Prince?!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.44,0:45:01.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.81,0:45:05.52,general text,,0,0,0,,His Highness wanted to take the Gwangju sword
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.61,0:45:07.48,general text,,0,0,0,,It was a dispute
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.19,0:45:10.15,italics,,0,0,0,,Even the Crown Prince forgave him
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.36,0:45:15.66,italics,,0,0,0,,His Highness’s sword was broken, but Uk still pointed his at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.74,0:45:18.58,general text,,0,0,0,,He put the life of the Crown Prince in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.66,0:45:19.66,general text,,0,0,0,,We were there too
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.79,0:45:21.87,general text,,0,0,0,,We were able to stop him
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.96,0:45:24.00,general text,,0,0,0,,This means that the four of you watched,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.08,0:45:26.25,general text,,0,0,0,,how they mocked His Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.71,0:45:31.72,general text,,0,0,0,,This is an insult to the royal family!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.72,0:45:36.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Lock up Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.39,0:45:41.56,general text,,0,0,0,,It is uncontrollable and dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.64,0:45:42.77,italics,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.21,0:46:04.17,general text,,0,0,0,,It was worth opening the energy gates,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.25,0:46:08.17,general text,,0,0,0,,how Chang Wook began to threaten the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.17,0:46:14.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Chonbugwan won’t leave this so easily
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.07,0:47:16.86,general text,,0,0,0,,You haven’t treated the wound yet, you’ve lost a lot of blood
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.24,0:47:21.62,general text,,0,0,0,,How is your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.33,0:47:27.54,general text,,0,0,0,,The bracelet does not allow her to move
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.37,0:47:29.63,general text,,0,0,0,,But I'm fine
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.38,0:47:34.55,general text,,0,0,0,,You were able to master the flow of energy from Master Ho Yeom
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.63,0:47:36.13,general text,,0,0,0,,in such a short time
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.30,0:47:38.51,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm really impressed
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.14,0:47:43.06,general text,,0,0,0,,At first my body was burning with fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.64,0:47:46.10,general text,,0,0,0,,and then it seemed to be covered with ice
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.85,0:47:50.10,general text,,0,0,0,,How are your wounds from the spanking?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.19,0:47:51.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Do they hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.36,0:47:58.40,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems that the spanking helped to collect energy
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.36,0:48:02.49,general text,,0,0,0,,The Crown Prince dealt me many blows,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.45,0:48:07.58,general text,,0,0,0,,after that I felt a surge of energy
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.66,0:48:09.04,general text,,0,0,0,,And then I was able to get the sword
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.42,0:48:12.42,general text,,0,0,0,,No wonder
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.17,0:48:17.59,general text,,0,0,0,,You always learned everything faster than others
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.76,0:48:22.60,italics,,0,0,0,,You learned to walk and run much earlier than Dan Gu
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.39,0:48:25.68,general text,,0,0,0,,And began to speak earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.85,0:48:28.27,general text,,0,0,0,,I remember this
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.06,0:48:32.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Until I found out that my energy gates were locked,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.15,0:48:36.65,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought I would become the strongest person
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.03,0:48:43.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.74,0:48:48.79,general text,,0,0,0,,You are smart and learn everything quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.29,0:48:55.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe you will become a merchant, learn how to do business?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.17,0:49:00.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Or master Ho Yeom will take him as a student and teach him medicine
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.64,0:49:06.68,general text,,0,0,0,,I refuse
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.73,0:49:12.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I will train in Jeonjingak and become a magician
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.65,0:49:14.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.69,0:49:18.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Because that’s what your father did?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.32,0:49:23.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to become the next Gwangju Jeonbugwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.16,0:49:26.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, and I will become one
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.99,0:49:29.62,general text,,0,0,0,,I will take his place
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.70,0:49:32.75,general text,,0,0,0,,and I will prove to these scoundrels who did not believe that I am his son
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.33,0:49:36.25,general text,,0,0,0,,- I will silence them all{\i1}\N- You...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.46,0:49:39.96,general text,,0,0,0,,not son
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.22,0:49:42.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Gan
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.64,0:49:46.93,italics,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.64,0:49:50.85,general text,,0,0,0,,the fruit of your mother’s betrayal
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.94,0:49:56.31,italics,,0,0,0,,We accepted you into the Chan family to show respect to your late mother
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.40,0:49:59.19,italics,,0,0,0,,But we can’t let you become the head of Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.28,0:50:02.40,general text,,0,0,0,,So stop dreaming of following in the footsteps
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.45,0:50:06.41,general text,,0,0,0,,his father
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.87,0:50:11.20,italics,,0,0,0,,Remain a clueless heir
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.91,0:50:14.46,italics,,0,0,0,,Chan family
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.33,0:50:17.46,general text,,0,0,0,,And then
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.21,0:50:21.30,general text,,0,0,0,,we will continue to take care of you
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.97,0:50:30.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.23,0:50:34.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Then who is my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.61,0:50:41.48,general text,,0,0,0,,How do we know who your late mother is with?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.15,0:50:45.91,general text,,0,0,0,,cheated on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.40,0:51:24.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Uka has a lot of thoughts in his head right now, leave him alone
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.87,0:51:32.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Make sure he eats everything
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.55,0:51:45.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim ordered me to make sure you eat everything
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.09,0:51:50.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Did he scold you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.81,0:51:55.35,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought you were used to being scolded...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.70,0:52:08.86,general text,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to do with it
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.95,0:52:12.24,general text,,0,0,0,,They probably haven’t fixed the passage yet after that incident
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.95,0:52:15.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t move
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.66,0:52:19.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Just stand there
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.75,0:52:24.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything can collapse
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.21,0:52:28.80,general text,,0,0,0,,So just stand still
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.69,0:52:44.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Why didn’t you dodge the sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.73,0:52:46.78,general text,,0,0,0,,This is because
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.28,0:52:49.74,general text,,0,0,0,,did you need another reason to kick him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.78,0:52:52.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I deserve it
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.87,0:52:56.45,general text,,0,0,0,,After all, I broke his heart
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.04,0:53:02.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Breaking his heart must have hurt more than taking a hit
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.17,0:53:05.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.13,0:53:11.13,general text,,0,0,0,,You said that there are rumors that I am Uka's father?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.68,0:53:13.59,general text,,0,0,0,,What if I say,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.26,0:53:18.35,general text,,0,0,0,,that I am really his father?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.14,0:53:24.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I will leave my position
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.98,0:53:28.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll start a little business
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.53,0:53:31.65,general text,,0,0,0,,and I’ll start trading with Ukom
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.24,0:53:34.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovoy Bor needs a chapter
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.03,0:53:38.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Or maybe say,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.50,0:53:41.54,general text,,0,0,0,,that I am his mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.33,0:53:43.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I think it will be better,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.62,0:53:47.09,general text,,0,0,0,,if Wook and I go to my home village, where we grew up with Lady Do Hwa
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.59,0:53:52.30,general text,,0,0,0,,This will not happen
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.93,0:53:58.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Wook is similar to Do Hwa, so
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.56,0:54:01.85,general text,,0,0,0,,he is so beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.94,0:54:04.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Who will believe that
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.44,0:54:08.02,general text,,0,0,0,,that you are his mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.23,0:54:11.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.03,0:54:15.87,general text,,0,0,0,,So, if I were his mother, he would be scary?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.87,0:54:19.24,general text,,0,0,0,,For that matter, you can’t be his father either
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.33,0:54:20.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course I can
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.58,0:54:24.04,italics,,0,0,0,,Chang Gang and I always kept pace,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.29,0:54:30.71,general text,,0,0,0,,when it came to appearance
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.84,0:54:34.97,general text,,0,0,0,,No, you lost
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.55,0:54:37.09,italics,,0,0,0,,You’re not even standing next to him
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.18,0:54:41.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Do Hwa said that she likes everything about you except your appearance
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.39,0:54:43.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t make things up!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.77,0:54:46.60,general text,,0,0,0,,You didn’t even flinch when you were hit with a sword
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.69,0:54:48.98,general text,,0,0,0,,But, I suppose, hearing that you are scary is more painful
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.06,0:54:50.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Rana
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.86,0:54:53.86,general text,,0,0,0,,it hurts a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.94,0:54:55.61,general text,,0,0,0,,You’re not pretending?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.70,0:54:58.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t move, otherwise the wound will open
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.28,0:55:01.49,general text,,0,0,0,,We share
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.70,0:55:05.75,general text,,0,0,0,,the same pain
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.25,0:55:09.84,italics,,0,0,0,,rejected by people,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.92,0:55:12.42,italics,,0,0,0,,who were loved
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.92,0:55:14.34,general text,,0,0,0,,So let's
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.59,0:55:17.01,general text,,0,0,0,,let's not hurt each other
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.80,0:55:22.39,general text,,0,0,0,,I admit that I did not want to offend you
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.47,0:55:23.85,general text,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.98,0:55:26.98,general text,,0,0,0,,kra...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.19,0:55:31.27,general text,,0,0,0,,kra...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.53,0:55:34.03,general text,,0,0,0,,beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.40,0:55:40.45,general text,,0,0,0,,You too, maid Kim,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.74,0:55:42.95,general text,,0,0,0,,kra...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.08,0:55:47.29,general text,,0,0,0,,beautiful...I
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.01,0:55:57.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Let me blow on your wound
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.63,0:55:59.84,general text,,0,0,0,,It hurts
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.26,0:56:04.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Just below
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.02,0:56:06.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, there
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.11,0:56:19.53,memories italics,,0,0,0,,It seems that the amulet is in Chwisongru
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.61,0:56:21.62,memories,,0,0,0,,belongs to Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.91,0:56:23.91,memories,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.99,0:56:26.79,memories,,0,0,0,,He was recently punished for losing an amulet
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.87,0:56:30.62,memories,,0,0,0,,And I heard that his maid often goes to that place
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.67,0:56:36.46,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,This girl from Sosnovy Bor is his maid,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.67,0:56:40.84,voiceover,,0,0,0,,and she was in the tavern that day
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.22,0:56:44.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Can she be
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.47,0:56:46.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.52,0:56:53.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Are we still far from Jeonbugwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.11,0:57:00.45,general text,,0,0,0,,At this rate I'll turn to stone
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.32,0:57:03.07,general text,,0,0,0,,We will speed up, be patient
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.62,0:57:05.53,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t lose control now
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.41,0:57:09.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.98,0:57:39.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Turn back
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.30,0:58:04.89,italics,,0,0,0,,Your hand... You comprehended Ryusa for such
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.97,0:58:07.39,general text,,0,0,0,,short time
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.76,0:58:11.98,italics,,0,0,0,,You are as smart as your father
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.85,0:58:16.31,italics,,0,0,0,,Jin Moo from Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.40,0:58:20.32,general text,,0,0,0,,started an argument only because he realized that the post of Gwangju would not happen to him
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.40,0:58:22.57,italics,,0,0,0,,He realized that you,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.65,0:58:25.70,italics,,0,0,0,,the eldest son of the Chan family, will you take this position
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.29,0:58:37.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Uncle’s wound is not so deep
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.25,0:58:38.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry about him
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.79,0:58:42.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll talk to Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.34,0:58:43.38,italics,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.43,0:58:50.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Take care of him
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.38,0:59:21.34,general text,,0,0,0,,When you're around, Uk is always in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.01,0:59:24.67,general text,,0,0,0,,You were with him when he drank the poison
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.76,0:59:27.59,general text,,0,0,0,,and when he grappled with the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.80,0:59:33.39,general text,,0,0,0,,So, do you want to separate us?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.47,0:59:34.68,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t do this
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.02,0:59:40.23,general text,,0,0,0,,He always got what he wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.86,0:59:42.65,general text,,0,0,0,,And you risked your life to save him
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.32,0:59:51.20,general text,,0,0,0,,This is his father's sword
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.28,0:59:52.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Take it
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.44,1:00:23.48,general text,,0,0,0,,I can't look at this anymore!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.57,1:00:25.23,general text,,0,0,0,,How long will you feel sorry for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.20,1:00:33.41,italics,,0,0,0,,Get up
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.67,1:00:48.84,general text,,0,0,0,,You received enormous energy and were able to cope with it
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.59,1:00:53.39,italics,,0,0,0,,People need 10 years to do this, it took you 10 days
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.47,1:00:55.47,general text,,0,0,0,,- Our training...\N- Forget it
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.56,1:00:56.97,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.98,1:01:01.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Refusing because of a few words from Park Jin?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.44,1:01:04.52,italics,,0,0,0,,So it was not strength, but stupidity
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.61,1:01:07.48,general text,,0,0,0,,No wonder you're so desperate. You are too weak!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.57,1:01:10.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I’m a weakling, so I won’t do anything
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.45,1:01:11.91,general text,,0,0,0,,So just shut up
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.70,1:01:15.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth and don’t pester me
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.17,1:01:25.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t need a student who is inactive
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.72,1:01:31.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Then don’t be my teacher,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.43,1:01:33.93,general text,,0,0,0,,you will be my maid
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.01,1:01:36.93,general text,,0,0,0,,If you make me angry again, I’ll sell it
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.09,1:02:17.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.43,1:02:24.06,general text,,0,0,0,,The owner is so worried that he doesn’t even drink water
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.14,1:02:26.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Help, please
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.19,1:02:27.77,general text,,0,0,0,,But what can I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.44,1:02:30.28,general text,,0,0,0,,We’d better wait for uncle to sort everything out
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.36,1:02:33.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Ho Yeom said he would help
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.70,1:02:37.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Ask him to quickly meet with Jin Mu and put an end to this
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.16,1:02:46.83,general text,,0,0,0,,I came to you because I’m worried about how small you would be
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.92,1:02:49.34,general text,,0,0,0,,did not inflate the problem
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.42,1:02:53.80,general text,,0,0,0,,How can a threat to the life of the Crown Prince be a small thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.34,1:02:59.51,general text,,0,0,0,,So our leader locked him up
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.14,1:03:02.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Pine forest will punish him
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.98,1:03:05.81,general text,,0,0,0,,When it comes to the royal family, the Pine Forest should not interfere
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.52,1:03:10.27,general text,,0,0,0,,This is Jeonbugwan’s responsibility, we will punish him ourselves
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.02,1:03:13.15,general text,,0,0,0,,And what will you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.24,1:03:17.07,general text,,0,0,0,,He threatened the Crown Prince, he should be executed
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.28,1:03:23.16,general text,,0,0,0,,But we cannot kill the only son of Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.83,1:03:27.67,general text,,0,0,0,,So let’s just cut off the hand that pointed the sword at the prince
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.33,1:03:30.25,italics,,0,0,0,,Cut off your hand?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.34,1:03:31.88,general text,,0,0,0,,You were probably offended by,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.96,1:03:34.21,italics,,0,0,0,,that your student could not defeat Uka,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.30,1:03:37.01,general text,,0,0,0,,the energy gates of which were opened just ten days ago
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.09,1:03:39.89,italics,,0,0,0,,Dumb, I’m here trying to save your and the prince’s reputation
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.97,1:03:42.22,general text,,0,0,0,,I was going to be nice
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.31,1:03:43.93,general text,,0,0,0,,But you're completely crazy!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.02,1:03:47.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Let Jeongbugwan decide whether I'm crazy or Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.85,1:03:50.90,general text,,0,0,0,,- Bastard...\N- Master, calmly
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.65,1:03:55.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Their fight was by mutual consent
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.90,1:03:58.28,general text,,0,0,0,,The maid Uka is to blame for what happened
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.24,1:04:03.04,general text,,0,0,0,,The fight was fair
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.24,1:04:08.92,general text,,0,0,0,,If you don’t believe us, let them fight again
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.17,1:04:16.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Again? Good idea
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.26,1:04:21.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Since you claim that Uk did not threaten the Crown Prince,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.35,1:04:22.93,general text,,0,0,0,,and the fight was fair,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.81,1:04:26.77,general text,,0,0,0,,let the official match take place
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.39,1:04:29.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Duel between Uk and the prince?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.27,1:04:33.23,general text,,0,0,0,,If you can’t accept this, give Uka to us
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.32,1:04:34.73,general text,,0,0,0,,But if you agree,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.82,1:04:39.24,general text,,0,0,0,,we will not hold anyone accountable, even if one of them dies
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.11,1:04:42.49,general text,,0,0,0,,In accordance with the customs of the Deho magicians
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.42,1:04:56.21,general text,,0,0,0,,We came to figure everything out, and what’s the end result?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.80,1:05:00.97,general text,,0,0,0,,It was the underwater snake that got the better of me
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.05,1:05:04.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk will die in an official battle. What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.14,1:05:05.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.51,1:05:07.85,general text,,0,0,0,,The Crown Prince will not accept the challenge
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.93,1:05:11.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Since Master So Kyung founded the Pine Forest,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.56,1:05:14.94,general text,,0,0,0,,the royal family and the magicians did not compete
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.02,1:05:16.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Both sides adhered to
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.61,1:05:21.49,general text,,0,0,0,,of this unspoken rule, so as not to waste energy
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.07,1:05:23.16,general text,,0,0,0,,It can’t be,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.24,1:05:26.62,general text,,0,0,0,,for the Crown Prince to break these rules and go against Uka
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.63,1:05:37.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Please accept the challenge
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.51,1:05:42.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t understand why I have to go against Sosnovy Bor because of this idiot
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.80,1:05:46.81,general text,,0,0,0,,They themselves made it so that they won’t point fingers at us
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.89,1:05:51.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Show Sosnovy Bor how strong you are
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.33,1:06:13.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Royal guards and the people of Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.00,1:06:15.17,general text,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.79,1:06:17.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Bless you, Master Ho
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.59,1:06:20.55,general text,,0,0,0,,He said it wouldn't happen
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.63,1:06:22.30,italics,,0,0,0,,But look
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.18,1:06:24.72,general text,,0,0,0,,What should we do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.68,1:06:30.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t understand why they are here?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.64,1:06:34.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I was just about to tell you
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.39,1:06:36.52,general text,,0,0,0,,But Jin Mu got ahead of me
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.94,1:06:39.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.90,1:06:42.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Did something happen again?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.15,1:06:45.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Let them all!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.66,1:06:47.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.57,1:06:50.24,general text,,0,0,0,,challenged Chan Wook to a duel
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.50,1:06:56.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwangju Deputy said that we should deliver Chang Wook to Jeonbugwan,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.54,1:06:58.96,general text,,0,0,0,,if he refuses the fight
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.54,1:07:02.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook is already locked here
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.30,1:07:07.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Deliver to Jeonbugwan? For what?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.89,1:07:09.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Ask Master Ho
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.39,1:07:13.68,general text,,0,0,0,,I was told that you agreed to these conditions
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.48,1:07:25.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk, get up. You need to run away from here
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.20,1:07:27.28,general text,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.36,1:07:30.74,general text,,0,0,0,,No time to explain. If we don't hurry, you'll lose your hand
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.66,1:07:33.41,general text,,0,0,0,,You might even die
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.00,1:07:35.29,general text,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- Host
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.87,1:07:37.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything has become more serious
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.50,1:07:40.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Stay here, then you will lose your hand or your life
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.04,1:07:42.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you going to sit like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.85,1:07:58.40,general text,,0,0,0,,I will go with Uk to the palace and meet with the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.98,1:08:00.94,general text,,0,0,0,,UK will be here soon
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.53,1:08:06.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is Uk?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.57,1:08:09.82,general text,,0,0,0,,He is not in the secret room. I think he ran away
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.53,1:08:11.53,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.71,1:08:21.17,general text,,0,0,0,,When stuck between a rock and a hard place,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.25,1:08:23.21,general text,,0,0,0,,escape is the only way out
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.18,1:08:34.10,general text,,0,0,0,,He was here the whole time. Only his maid came in and out
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.68,1:08:36.27,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t understand how he escaped
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.89,1:08:40.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Where are Yul and Dan Gu?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.61,1:08:53.24,general text,,0,0,0,,The chapter will sort everything out. Keep your head down until things calm down
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.58,1:08:57.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, take care of him
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.25,1:09:01.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you sure we don’t need you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.33,1:09:03.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, we will go to my home village
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.92,1:09:05.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Sari Village, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.96,1:09:08.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Stay there. We'll come for you
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.89,1:09:17.10,general text,,0,0,0,,You put him in danger again
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.35,1:09:22.73,general text,,0,0,0,,And he will get what he wants again
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.01,1:09:51.34,general text,,0,0,0,,The fight will take place
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.63,1:09:56.43,general text,,0,0,0,,in the middle of next month
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.89,1:10:01.23,general text,,0,0,0,,But if
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.10,1:10:03.98,general text,,0,0,0,,he will not appear on that day,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.81,1:10:07.82,general text,,0,0,0,,take this as defeat
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.90,1:10:10.36,general text,,0,0,0,,This is an escape, not a defeat
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.45,1:10:15.12,general text,,0,0,0,,I think such cowards should be punished
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.70,1:10:19.33,general text,,0,0,0,,I agree with him
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.95,1:10:22.25,general text,,0,0,0,,If Chang Wook doesn’t come back,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.83,1:10:25.13,general text,,0,0,0,,he will be deprived of the right to become
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.08,1:10:27.17,general text,,0,0,0,,next Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.09,1:10:37.35,general text,,0,0,0,,So be it, Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.95,1:10:57.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you take it if we are running away?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.37,1:10:59.78,general text,,0,0,0,,For training
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.87,1:11:01.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Training?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.16,1:11:02.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Are we going to train?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.04,1:11:05.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you behind this?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.17,1:11:06.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Contributed
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.13,1:11:09.96,general text,,0,0,0,,You finally moved when I said you were in danger
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.05,1:11:13.30,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.38,1:11:15.47,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t need a student who doesn’t make progress
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.26,1:11:18.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Just die if you're not going to do anything
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.93,1:11:20.76,general text,,0,0,0,,You poisoned me again,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.93,1:11:23.64,general text,,0,0,0,,my crazy master
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.31,1:11:25.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.14,1:11:29.52,general text,,0,0,0,,We are going to where I trained. Get ready
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.15,1:11:33.61,general text,,0,0,0,,There will be no warm baths there
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.69,1:11:38.28,general text,,0,0,0,,No beds, no your favorite food
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.45,1:11:43.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Is Sari Village so scary?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.25,1:11:46.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok lived in Sari
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.96,1:11:48.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su is from the same place
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.00,1:11:51.38,general text,,0,0,0,,from Danhyanggok
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.76,1:11:55.47,general text,,0,0,0,,That's where we're heading
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.94,1:12:53.73,preview,,0,0,0,,What is all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.82,1:12:54.94,preview,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.02,1:12:58.03,preview,,0,0,0,,I almost took this for an attempt to kidnap me and live with me
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.11,1:12:59.78,preview,,0,0,0,,under the guise of training
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.86,1:13:02.82,preview,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, I can teach you differently
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.91,1:13:05.62,preview,,0,0,0,,Such girls are the most dangerous
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.70,1:13:07.20,preview,,0,0,0,,I don’t like sweets
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.29,1:13:09.50,preview,,0,0,0,,Well, please, if you don’t like it
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.58,1:13:12.92,preview,,0,0,0,,- Yul is cooking rice with Moo Deok!\N- I told you...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.00,1:13:16.92,preview,,0,0,0,,How can you teach someone else when your student is here?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.01,1:13:20.09,preview,,0,0,0,,What if we deprive him of the right to be called a magician?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.17,1:13:23.05,preview,,0,0,0,,Wherever he goes, he cannot find a teacher
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.14,1:13:26.31,preview,,0,0,0,,An amazing soul migrated into this body
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.39,1:13:27.35,preview,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.43,1:13:28.73,preview,,0,0,0,,I didn’t want to do anything...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.81,1:13:30.31,preview,,0,0,0,,but something bothers me
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.58,0:35:40.58,preview,,0,0,0,,

Comment: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:47.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Beta editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Sana
